refactor(fleet): extract batch and similar tests to sibling files

batch.rs and similar.rs were both bumping the 300-line cap because
their unit tests lived inline with the implementation. Move them
out to batch_tests.rs and similar_tests.rs and wire them in via
#[path = "..."] mod tests;
the same pattern already used by patterns / duplicates / recall in
this crate.

No test was removed; cargo test -p convergio-fleet still reports
the same passing counts.

